{"case_id":"company-001","task":"company_basics","prompt":"对一家供应链候选公司给出 ticker、交易所、币种、主营业务、收入结构、客户、地区、竞争格局、财务质量和风险。","expected":{"must_include":["CompanyProfile","ticker","exchange","currency","revenue_mix","customers","geographies","competitors","financial_quality","risks"]}}
