{"case_id":"company-003","task":"market_cap_basis","prompt":"市场价值是报道值还是价格乘股本计算值？请保留 share basis 和 currency。","expected":{"must_include":["market_cap_basis","shares_basis","quote_currency","calculation"]}}
{"case_id":"company-004","task":"bottleneck_object","prompt":"把物理卡点拆成供应商集中度、替代性、认证、扩产、客户紧迫性、产能可见度、定价权和价值捕获。","expected":{"must_include":["BottleneckAssessment","supplier_concentration","substitutability","qualification","expansion","customer_urgency","pricing_power","economic_value_capture"]}}
