{"case_id":"company-006","task":"conditional_interest","prompt":"说明为什么这家公司值得进一步研究，但必须写成 if/then/fail-if 条件，不能直接喊买入。","expected":{"must_include":["conditional_reasons","confirm_with","fail_if","research_priority","no_buy_sell"]}}
{"case_id":"company-007","task":"business_model_bridge","prompt":"分别说明制造商、设备商、耗材商、IP 和项目公司的瓶颈到收入利润现金流稀释桥接。","expected":{"must_include":["business_model","revenue","gross_profit","cash_flow","funding","dilution"]}}
