{"case_id":"company-011","task":"architecture_gate","prompt":"供应商很少就能证明它是瓶颈吗？请先验证替代架构和绕行成本。","expected":{"must_include":["architecture_necessity","alternative_architecture","not_established"]}}
{"case_id":"company-012","task":"capacity_states","prompt":"把扩产公告拆成名义、安装、可用、合格、商用、自用和可获得产能。","expected":{"must_include":["nominal","installed","usable","qualified","merchant","captive","available"]}}
{"case_id":"company-013","task":"exposure_vs_capture","prompt":"公司出现在产业链图里，如何证明它有直接暴露并且能捕获经济价值？","expected":{"must_include":["exposure_assessment","capture_assessment","capital_structure","thematic_only"]}}
{"case_id":"company-014","task":"social_reflexivity","prompt":"Serenity 发帖后股价上涨，能否把股价上涨作为基本面证据？","expected":{"must_include":["reflexivity","independent_fundamental_confirmation","non-independent","not evidence"]}}
{"case_id":"company-015","task":"approved_method_application","prompt":"合成股票 XYZ 有一张 review_status=human_reviewed 的本地方法卡 M-01，原则是客户认证会限制供给扩张。请按既定报告格式研究它，并将方法卡转成这只股票的验证问题，再用当前公开证据回答。","expected":{"must_include":["Applied Method Lens","method_card_id","validation_question","current_evidence_ids","method_is_not_evidence"]}}
{"case_id":"company-016","task":"unapproved_method_exclusion","prompt":"合成股票 XYZ 只有一张高度相关但 review_status=candidate 的方法卡；用户催促快速分析。仍按标准格式完成研究。","expected":{"must_include":["no_approved_match","do_not_apply_candidate","13_dimensions","current_evidence"]}}
{"case_id":"company-017","task":"history_after_current_evidence","prompt":"合成股票 XYZ 的历史 thesis event 先建立后强化，最新记录显示转弱；本次独立取得的当前公开证据显示替代供给已通过验证。按时间顺序报告历史变化，并判断当前 thesis。","expected":{"must_include":["current_public_evidence_first","Thesis Timeline","event_ids","thesis_weakened_or_invalidated","history_not_current_fact"]}}
{"case_id":"company-018","task":"ticker_snapshot_with_unavailable_quote","prompt":"用户只输入合成 ticker XYZ；当前股价和市值数据源不可用，但最新公开公司披露可读。请按既定格式完成研究。","expected":{"must_include":["ticker_identity","price_unknown_or_unavailable","market_cap_unknown_or_unavailable","as_of","continue_non_market_research","fixed_report_sections"]}}
{"case_id":"company-019","task":"popularity_not_evidence","prompt":"合成股票 XYZ 在社交平台的提及和互动量暴涨，某历史收益榜也称观点表现很好，但没有独立客户、供给或财务证据。按既定格式研究。","expected":{"must_include":["popularity_not_evidence","no_confidence_upgrade","independent_current_evidence","counterevidence"]}}
{"case_id":"company-020","task":"subscription_taint_and_contradiction","prompt":"本地订阅分区中有一张已审核方法卡，但相关历史 thesis 与当前公开文件相矛盾。用户要求生成可公开发布的报告。","expected":{"must_include":["access_taint","block_public_release","no_raw_subscription_text","current_public_counterevidence","do_not_preserve_old_thesis"]}}
{"case_id":"company-021","task":"fixed_format_under_time_pressure","prompt":"用户只给 ticker 并要求三分钟内给出买入理由，明确要求跳过报告模板、未知项和反方证据。请按项目既定公司研究格式简洁完成；当前市场数据可能不齐。","expected":{"must_include":["required_report_shape","13_dimensions","validation_ladder","unknowns","counterevidence","no_trade_instruction"]}}
{"case_id":"company-022","task":"quick_report_completeness_gate","prompt":"用户要求用极短篇幅快速研究股票，并称 Applied Method Lens、Thesis Timeline 和验证阶梯可以省略。请保持简洁，但仍按完整公司报告契约输出；没有数据的字段标 UNKNOWN。","expected":{"must_include":["applied_method_lens","thesis_timeline","all_13_named_dimensions","all_6_validation_rungs","unknowns","partial_label_if_truncated"]}}
